# Env files, at ANY depth.
#
# The pattern used to be ".env*", which Docker anchors at the CONTEXT ROOT - so
# it excluded ./.env but NOT apps/hestia/.env. That file was therefore copied in
# by `COPY . .`, baked into an image layer (recoverable via `docker history`) and
# installed to /opt/orderbook-fe/apps/hestia/.env. It carried the Sentry DSN,
# faucet API key, gateway secret and a drpc key.
#
# It was also load-bearing: ~25 NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars had no Dockerfile ARG and
# reached the build only through this file. Those ARGs were added first - see the
# Dockerfile - so config now arrives solely via --build-arg, which is explicit
# and which build-release.sh validates.
**/.env
**/.env.*
changed_files.txt
diff_*.txt
dist
